  dct:description """Heavy equipment transporters for the Georgian Defence Forces.
The purpose of the procurement is to implement the European Peace Facility, as provided for in Council of the European Union Decision No. 2023/920 of 4 May 2023 on the support instrument under the European Peace Facility in support of the Georgian Defence Forces."""@en,
    """Sunkiosios technikos pervežimo sunkvežimiai Sakartvelo gynybos pajėgoms.
Pirkimu siekiama įgyvendinti Europos taikos priemonę, kaip numatyta Europos Sąjungos Tarybos 2023 m. gegužės 4 d. sprendime Nr. 2023/920 dėl paramos priemonės pagal Europos taikos priemonę Sakartvelo gynybos pajėgoms remti."""@lt;
  dct:title "Heavy equipment transporters"@en, "Sunkiosios technikos pervežimo sunkvežimiai"@lt;
